-1. **Load Data**: Read camera extrinsics, image intrinsics, and 3D points using `read_model(path=model_path, ext=".bin")` [S2, unofficial]. Alternatively, load trajectories from `.npy` files as raw numpy arrays or `.json` files (instant-npg/sdfstudio format) by parsing `transform_matrix` from frames [S1, unofficial].
